  "_selection": "Derived by FORM, not by value: a new upstream subject earns an entry only when it reaches a branch of parse_github_sub that no vendored subject already reaches. That is why subvectors 0.6.0's 'environment:Production-sandbox' is absent (a new value of the environment form already covered) while 'environment:Production%3AV1' is present (the only vendored subject whose decoded value differs from its raw text, so the sole guard on the percent-decoding)."
